  "verseCount": 8,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkitanyaanyukoto naipirta olchani loo sabibu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu ororei lo Laitoriani enatii ejo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Enkerai e tung'ani, kaji eiko enchata olchani loo sabibu tenegiroo te nkadori likae shani ake pooki, olng'osila lo sabibu otii atua ilkeek le ntim? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keyae enchata te ninye aaitobirie ae toki? Keya iltung'ana enchata te ninye aililiyie ake pooki girra? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura, epiki ninye enkima metaa eilata enye; ore peyie emut enkima ineeiting'ie enyena pokira, ore empolos enye netumute, keitoki aata tipat tiae toki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ing'ura, ore apa eton elulung'a ninye, nemeeta ae naitaasi; kebaa meeta tipat etumuta enkima ninye, keitoki aata tipat tiae toki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: anaa enatiu ilkeek to olchani loo sabibu tiatua entim, ilo latipika enkima meitaa eilata, neaku neijia alo ake lelo oomanya Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kaitorioki ninye enkomom ai agilunore ninche; hoo neilanyisho ninche aing'uaa enkima, kenya ina kima ninche amut; niyiolouu aajo ara nanu Olaitoriani tenaitorioki ninche enkomom ai agilunore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kaitaa enkop mitil, amu etaa ninche ilemeeta enkirukoto, ejo Olaitoriani Enkai.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
